.pdf","source_title":"UNC-Chapel Hill Visitors Guide","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Check University event scheduling before planning an interior visit.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"ackland-art-museum","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Ackland Art Museum","title":"Spend an afternoon at the Ackland","subtitle":"101 S. Columbia Street · art museum","notes":"Browse the galleries at your own pace, then check the current calendar for public art activities that fit the day you visit.","short_summary":"A campus museum with free public admission.","evidence_claim":"The Ackland states that admission is always free and lists its location at 101 S. Columbia Street in Chapel Hill.","source_url":"https://ackland.org/visit/","source_title":"Visit the Ackland Art Museum at UNC-Chapel Hill","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Regular hours listed are Wednesday–Saturday 10 a.m.–5 p.m. and Sunday 1–5 p.m.; verify holiday changes.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"morehead-planetarium-science-center","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Morehead Planetarium and Science Center","title":"Close with Morehead’s exhibits or a show","subtitle":"Morehead Building · science-center stop","notes":"Choose either general-admission exhibits or a scheduled planetarium show, and reserve or buy tickets only after checking the current calendar.","short_summary":"A ticketed planetarium option with UNC-student admission benefits.","evidence_claim":"Morehead lists Tuesday–Friday, Saturday, and Sunday hours and says UNC students with a valid One Card receive free general admission and $6 show bundles.","source_url":"https://moreheadplanetarium.org/visit/","source_title":"Plan A Visit - Morehead Planetarium and Science Center","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Listed hours are Tue–Fri 10 a.m.–4:30 p.m., Sat 10 a.m.–6 p.m., and Sun 1–6 p.m.; ticketing applies to shows.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
